-- An explicit `MKL_CBWR` is preserved, including `AVX2,STRICT` and
+- MKL defaults to `COMPATIBLE`, its cross-vendor SSE2 CNR branch. Keep the
+  thread count fixed; this mode does not provide strict CNR across thread counts
+  and can be slower than AVX2. An explicit `MKL_CBWR` is preserved, including
+  `AVX2`, `AVX2,STRICT`, and
